					<div class="xsmall">4/14/2002 - 5:04 AM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2488">Givins Ntakhiens</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2861">Felious Gudlious</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2487">Izzek Krakumheads</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														I think it's clear that this is a guild that isn't made up of people that want to raid.  I think our base uses the LOIL, FM, OT and DL cycle.  There is no point in scheduling raids until there is enough interest in the guild from more than 2-3 members.						</td>
